The '''Biochemical Workbench''' is one of the eleven workbench types in ''[[Human Host]]''.

Refines reagents into medicine, explosives, and gunpowder.

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.BiochemicalWorkbench</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Biochemical</code>.

